
        <html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
        <head>
          <meta charset="utf-8">
          <title>SQM项目</title>
          <!--[if gte mso 9]>
          <xml>
            <w:WordDocument>
              <w:View>Print</w:View>
              <w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom>
              <w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/>
            </w:WordDocument>
          </xml>
          <![endif]-->
          <style>
            @page Section1 {
              size: 595.3pt 841.9pt; /* A4 标准纸张 */
              margin: 42.5pt 42.5pt 42.5pt 42.5pt; /* 1.5cm 窄边距，确保有效版面宽达 ~510pt */
              mso-header-margin: 36.0pt;
              mso-footer-margin: 36.0pt;
              mso-paper-source: 0;
            }
            div.Section1 { 
              page: Section1;
              width: 100% !important;
              max-width: 510pt !important;
            }
            body { 
              font-family: SimSun, Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; 
              color: #1e293b; 
              line-height: 1.6; 
              margin: 0; 
              padding: 0;
            }
            h1 { font-size: 22pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 14pt; text-align: center; }
            h2 { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4pt; }
            h3 { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; }
            h4, h5, h6 { font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; }
            p { font-size: 10.5pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: justify; }
            
            /* 🔴 表格防溢出核心：固定表格布局 + 单元格与代码全量自动强制断行 */
            table { 
              border-collapse: collapse !important; 
              width: 100% !important; 
              max-width: 100% !important;
              table-layout: fixed !important; 
              margin: 12pt 0 !important; 
              word-break: break-all !important;
              word-wrap: break-word !important;
              mso-table-layout-alt: fixed !important;
            }
            table, th, td { 
              border: 1px solid #333333 !important; 
              padding: 6px 8px !important; 
              font-size: 10pt !important; 
              word-break: break-all !important;
              word-wrap: break-word !important;
              overflow-wrap: break-word !important;
            }
            th { 
              background-color: #f1f5f9 !important; 
              font-weight: bold !important; 
              text-align: left !important; 
              word-break: break-all !important;
              word-wrap: break-word !important;
            }
            
            /* 代码块与行内标签自动折行 */
            pre { 
              background: #f8fafc !important; 
              border: 1px solid #cbd5e1 !important; 
              border-radius: 4px; 
              padding: 6pt 8pt !important; 
              font-family: Consolas, Monaco, monospace !important; 
              font-size: 9pt !important; 
              white-space: pre-wrap !important; 
              word-break: break-all !important; 
              word-wrap: break-word !important;
              max-width: 100% !important;
            }
            code { 
              font-family: Consolas, monospace !important; 
              background: #f1f5f9 !important; 
              padding: 2px 4px !important; 
              border-radius: 2px; 
              color: #0284c7 !important; 
              white-space: pre-wrap !important; 
              word-break: break-all !important; 
              word-wrap: break-word !important;
              max-width: 100% !important;
            }
            
            /* 🔴 图片防溢出：Word 不支持 max-width，必须显式约束 */
            img { 
              width: 100% !important; 
              max-width: 500pt !important; 
              height: auto !important; 
            }
            
            blockquote { 
              border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; 
              padding: 6pt 12pt; 
              background-color: #f8fafc; 
              margin: 8pt 0; 
              color: #475569; 
            }
          </style>
        </head>
        <body>
          <div class="Section1">
            <h1>SQM项目</h1>
            <div><h2 id="w-e-element-2385" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2386" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">1. 项目架构确认与技术栈定位</span></span></span></h2><p id="w-e-element-2387" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2388" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">本项目为完全独立的轻量级供应商与质量管理系统（SQM），与当前平台物理与逻辑彻底解耦，针对开发者提出的四大核心关切实施针对性架构升级。</span></span></span></p><h3 id="w-e-element-2389" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2390" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">1.1 后端技术栈：标准选择 Python FastAPI</span></span></span></h3><p id="w-e-element-2391" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2392" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">后端确认采用 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2393" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">Python FastAPI</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2394" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 框架，技术优势如下：</span></span></span></p><div id="w-e-element-2395" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2396" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">原生异步高性能</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2397" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：基于 ASGI 与 Starlette，具备高并发吞吐能力。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2398" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2399" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">强类型契约校验</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2400" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：全面采用 Pydantic 数据模型，入参与出参自动校验与转换。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2401" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2402" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">自动交互式文档</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2403" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：开箱即用 Swagger UI 接口文档（</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2404" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">/docs</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2405" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">），前后端联调零沟通成本。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2406" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2407" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">无缝轻量化集成</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2408" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：与 SQLAlchemy ORM 及 Alembic 迁移工具无缝生态融合。</span></span></span></span></div><h3 id="w-e-element-2409" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2410" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">1.2 动态附件存储库与组件解耦规范</span></span></span></h3><p id="w-e-element-2411" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2412" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">针对文件路径与代码耦合痛点，系统确立</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2413" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">动态流式存储与独立功能包解耦规范</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2414" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：</span></span></span></p><div id="w-e-element-2415" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2416" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">存储拒绝死板分类</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2417" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：废弃按 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2418" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">documents/images</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2419" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 硬编码静态目录的方式，底层统一使用 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2420" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">storage/files/</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2421" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 并由后端按“业务域/年月”（如 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2422" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">files/sqm/202610/{uuid}.ext</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2423" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">）动态流式生成路径，通过数据库附件表（</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2424" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">attachment</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2425" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">）记录原名与 MIME 类型，适配一切业务扩展。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2426" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2427" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">组件独立包化（Feature Folders）</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2428" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：富文本（WangEditor 5）与文件上传器属于具有专属依赖和配置的复合组件，不扁平放置于 components 根目录，而是各自设立独立包（</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2429" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">components/editor/</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2430" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">、</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2431" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">components/uploader/</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2432" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">），实现自包含与完全解耦。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2433" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2434" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">环境动态适配</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2435" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：在 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2436" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">.env</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2437" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 中配置 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2438" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">STORAGE_ROOT_PATH=../storage</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2439" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">，代码中严禁硬编码相对或绝对路径，跨机复制即开即用。</span></span></span></span></div><h2 id="w-e-element-2440" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2441" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">2. 前端功能编号与路由导航规范</span></span></span></h2><p id="w-e-element-2442" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2443" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">前端遵循“左侧纯中文编号导航 + 右侧沉浸工作区”布局，业务模块严格进行多级功能编号：</span></span></span></p><h3 id="w-e-element-2444" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2445" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">2.1 业务功能分类编号矩阵</span></span></span></h3><div class="table-container" id="w-e-element-2446" data-slate-node="element"><table width="auto" contenteditable="false" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse: collapse !important; width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; table-layout: fixed !important; margin: 12pt 0px !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><colgroup><col width="auto"><col width="auto"><col width="auto"></colgroup><tbody><tr id="w-e-element-2447" data-slate-node="element"><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2448" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2449" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">一级模块编号与名称</span></span></span></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2450" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2451" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">二级功能编号与视图名称</span></span></span></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2452" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2453" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">核心业务范畴与职责</span></span></span></th></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2454" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2455" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2456" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">1. MainData（主数据）</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2457" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2458" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">1.1 供应商清单 (SupplierList)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2459" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2460" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">供应商准入状态（潜在/考察/合格/冻结）、资质认证与开发台账。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2461" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2462" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2463" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">1. MainData（主数据）</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2464" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2465" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">1.2 零件清单 (PartList)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2466" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2467" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">按项目/车型归属维护物料编码、中文名称、图纸版本及工程师责任。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2468" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2469" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2470" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">1. MainData（主数据）</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2471" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2472" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">1.3 项目清单 (ProjectList)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2473" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2474" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">车型/产品项目代码、开发周期阶段、量产节点（SOP）统筹。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2475" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2476" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2477" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">2. SQM（供应商质量管理）</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2478" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2479" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">2.1 零件开发管理 (PartDevelopment)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2480" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2481" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">零件与供应商双向绑定，APQP/PPAP/OTS 试制样件流转与状态矩阵。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2482" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2483" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2484" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">2. SQM（供应商质量管理）</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2485" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2486" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">2.2 质量问题清单 (QualityIssue)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2487" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2488" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">质量异常记录、发生问题描述，支持上传并归档供应商改善报告附件（轻量化记录，暂不引入复杂8D工作流）。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2489" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2490" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2491" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">3. CTQ（关键质量特性）</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2492" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2493" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">3.1 关键特征清单 (CTQList)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2494" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2495" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">KPC 产品关键特性、KCC 过程关键特性、质量公差与检验频次定义。</span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id="w-e-element-2496" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2497" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">2.2 基础工具组件支撑</span></span></span></h3><p id="w-e-element-2498" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2499" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">工作区内置 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2500" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">WangEditor 5</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2501" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 富文本组件支持质量分析报告图文排版，并配套</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2502" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">独立附件上传组件</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2503" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">，无缝对接顶级 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2504" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">storage/</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2505" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 存储空间。</span></span></span></p><h3 id="w-e-element-2506" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2507" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">2.3 交互范式、防呆机制与开发态提词器</span></span></span></h3><div id="w-e-element-2508" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2509" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">Element Plus 深度整合</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2510" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：全站采用 Element Plus 构建工业级清晰布局，无缝适配中文环境。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2511" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2512" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">列表与表单物理绝对解耦</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2513" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：每个功能单元均拆分独立目录（如 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2514" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">1.1_supplier/</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2515" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">），</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2516" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">SupplierList.vue</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2517" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 仅负责列表筛选与分页渲染，</span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2518" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">SupplierForm.vue</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2519" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 专职承载表单细节，互不污染。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2520" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2521" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">70% 宽幅沉浸式右滑抽屉</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2522" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：新建与编辑统一通过右侧平滑滑出的 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2523" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">el-drawer</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2524" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 呈现，默认宽度 70%，兼顾大屏编辑舒适度与母列表上下文参照。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2525" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2526" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">退出防呆安全机制（Dirty Check）</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2527" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：表单引入脏检查钩子，用户修改但未保存时触发关闭操作，系统强制弹出二次确认：“当前修改尚未保存，确认退出将丢失修改？”，杜绝误操作。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2528" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2529" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">免密直进极速交付</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2530" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：初始阶段去除登录与鉴权守卫，系统启动后直接进入主业务工作台，全力聚焦核心功能闭环。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2531" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2532" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">AI 提词器（Alt+X）开发套件</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2533" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：内置 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2534" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">components/dev/teleprompter/</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2535" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">，按下 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2536" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">Alt+X</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2537" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 即刻接管鼠标开启 DOM 元素拾取，自动生成包含当前组件名称、行号及信标代码的结构化提示词，一键复制投递。</span></span></span></span></div><h2 id="w-e-element-2538" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2539" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">3. 数据库设计、迁移演进与 ER 关系模型</span></span></span></h2><p id="w-e-element-2540" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2541" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">针对“目标机器已有历史数据，新增或修改字段时不损坏现有数据”的硬性要求，系统采用 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2542" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">Alembic</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2543" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 数据库版本迁移机制（类 Git 机制），彻底杜绝删表重建。</span></span></span></p><h3 id="w-e-element-2544" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2545" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">3.1 Alembic 迁移工作原理</span></span></span></h3><div id="w-e-element-2546" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2547" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">变更捕获</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2548" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：开发者在 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2549" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">models/</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2550" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 中修改实体类字段（如新增列、修改注释、变更字段长度）。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2551" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2552" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">脚本生成</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2553" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：执行 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2554" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add_xxx_field"</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2555" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 自动生成单向增量 DDL 脚本。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2556" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2557" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">版本对齐</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2558" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：数据库内部维护 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2559" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">alembic_version</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2560" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 单行版本指针，精准记录当前库结构代际。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2561" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">•</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2562" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">热升级应用</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2563" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：在目标电脑拉取代码后，仅需执行 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2564" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">alembic upgrade head</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2565" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">，Alembic 自动比对差异，在保留全量历史数据前提下执行 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2566" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2567" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">，零数据丢失风险。</span></span></span></span></div><h3 id="w-e-element-2568" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2569" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">3.2 核心数据表清单与字段结构规范</span></span></span></h3><div class="table-container" id="w-e-element-2570" data-slate-node="element"><table width="auto" contenteditable="false" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="6" style="border-collapse: collapse !important; width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; table-layout: fixed !important; margin: 12pt 0px !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><colgroup><col width="auto"><col width="auto"><col width="auto"><col width="auto"></colgroup><tbody><tr id="w-e-element-2571" data-slate-node="element"><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2572" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2573" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">数据表物理名</span></span></span></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2574" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2575" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">业务模型定位</span></span></span></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2576" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2577" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">核心主外键字段</span></span></span></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2578" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2579" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">主要业务字段与类型说明</span></span></span></th></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2580" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2581" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2582" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">sqm_supplier</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2583" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2584" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">供应商主数据表</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2585" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2586" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">id (PK 自增主键)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2587" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2588" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">code (VARCHAR 供应商编码), name (VARCHAR 中文名称), status (VARCHAR 准入状态: 潜在/考察/合格/冻结), contact (VARCHAR 联络人)</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2589" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2590" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2591" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">sqm_project</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2592" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2593" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">新产品项目表</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2594" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2595" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">id (PK 自增主键)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2596" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2597" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">project_code (VARCHAR 唯一代号), name (VARCHAR 项目名), platform (VARCHAR 平台车型), sop_date (DATE 量产节点)</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2598" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2599" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2600" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">sqm_part</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2601" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2602" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">零件主数据表</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2603" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2604" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">id (PK), project_id (FK 关联项目)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2605" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2606" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">part_no (VARCHAR 零件图号), name (VARCHAR 零件名称), category (VARCHAR 类别), drawing_version (VARCHAR 图纸版本)</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2607" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2608" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2609" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">sqm_part_dev</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2610" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2611" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">零件开发管理表</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2612" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2613" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">id (PK), part_id (FK), supplier_id (FK)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2614" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2615" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">dev_phase (VARCHAR 阶段: OTS/工装样件/PPAP), status (VARCHAR 审批状态), target_sop (DATE 计划节点)</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2616" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2617" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2618" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">sqm_ctq</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2619" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2620" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">关键质量特性表</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2621" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2622" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">id (PK), part_id (FK 关联零件)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2623" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2624" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">feature_code (VARCHAR 特征代号), feature_type (VARCHAR KPC产品/KCC过程特性), tolerance (VARCHAR 规格与公差要求)</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2625" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2626" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2627" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">sqm_quality_issue</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2628" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2629" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">质量问题清单表</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2630" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2631" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">id (PK), part_id (FK), supplier_id (FK)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2632" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2633" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">issue_no (VARCHAR 问题单号), issue_desc (TEXT 现象描述), status (VARCHAR 状态: 登记/已提改善/闭环)</span></span></span></td></tr><tr id="w-e-element-2634" data-slate-node="element"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2635" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2636" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">sys_attachment</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2637" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2638" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">通用附件元数据表</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2639" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2640" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">id (PK 物理主键)</span></span></span></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" id="w-e-element-2641" data-slate-node="element" style="border: 1px solid rgb(51, 51, 51) !important; padding: 6px 8px !important; font-size: 10pt !important; word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span id="w-e-text-2642" data-slate-node="text" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;"><span data-slate-string="true" style="word-break: break-all !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; white-space: pre-wrap !important; max-width: 100% !important;">file_path (VARCHAR 动态分片相对路径), original_name (VARCHAR 原文件名), biz_type (VARCHAR 业务域), biz_id (INT 业务外键)</span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id="w-e-element-2643" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2644" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">3.3 数据库实体关系模型（ER 拓扑图）</span></span></span></h3><p id="w-e-element-2645" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2646" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">系统 7 大核心数据表的实体关系（ER）与主外键级联交互拓扑如下：</span></span></span></p><div id="w-e-element-2647" data-slate-node="element" data-slate-void="true" style="position: relative;"><div style="text-align: center; margin: 16pt 0px; max-width: 100%;">
              <img src="data:image/png;base64," width="500" alt="Mermaid 流程图" style="width: 100%; max-width: 500pt; height: auto; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 4px;">
              <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4pt;">[流程图 / 架构图]</div>
            </div><div data-slate-spacer="true" style="height: 0px; color: transparent; outline: none; position: absolute;"><span id="w-e-text-2648" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-zero-width="z">﻿</span></span></span></div></div><h2 id="w-e-element-2649" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2650" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">4. 系统集成架构拓扑</span></span></span></h2><p id="w-e-element-2651" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2652" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">系统整体架构、模块流向与数据资产交互图如下：</span></span></span></p><div id="w-e-element-2653" data-slate-node="element" data-slate-void="true" style="position: relative;"><div style="text-align: center; margin: 16pt 0px; max-width: 100%;">
              <img src="data:image/png;base64," width="500" alt="Mermaid 流程图" style="width: 100%; max-width: 500pt; height: auto; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 4px;">
              <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4pt;">[流程图 / 架构图]</div>
            </div><div data-slate-spacer="true" style="height: 0px; color: transparent; outline: none; position: absolute;"><span id="w-e-text-2654" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-zero-width="z">﻿</span></span></span></div></div><h2 id="w-e-element-2655" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2656" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">5. 优化后物理工程文件树</span></span></span></h2><p id="w-e-element-2657" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2658" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">依据列表与表单物理彻底解耦、70% 宽幅抽屉防呆以及开发态 AI 提词器要求，系统工程文件树进一步迭代规范如下：</span></span></span></p><pre id="w-e-element-2659" data-slate-node="element"><code id="w-e-element-2660" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2661" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">sqm-standalone/
├── .env.example                     # 环境变量模版 (提交版本库)
├── .env                             # 本地私有环境变量 (两台电脑各自配置，不入库)
├── README.md                        # 项目初始化、迁移与 Alembic 升级指南
├── storage/                         # 顶级通用文件存储库 (动态分片，拒绝死板分类)
│   └── files/                       # 动态目录流 (如 files/sqm/202610/uuid.ext)
├── backend/                         # 后端工程 (FastAPI 免密直进)
│   ├── alembic/                     # 数据库版本迁移管理 (保留历史数据热升级)
│   │   ├── versions/                # 增量变更版本脚本库 (001_init.py, 002_add_col.py)
│   │   └── env.py                   # Alembic 数据库连接与配置注入
│   ├── alembic.ini                  # Alembic 配置文件
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── __init__.py
│   │   ├── main.py                  # FastAPI 服务入口与静态存储路由挂载
│   │   ├── core/                    # 核心配置
│   │   │   ├── config.py            # 读取 .env (含 DB 密码与 storage 根路径)
│   │   │   └── database.py          # 数据库引擎与 SessionLocal
│   │   ├── models/                  # SQLAlchemy ORM 实体模型
│   │   │   ├── main_data.py         # 供应商、零件、项目模型
│   │   │   ├── sqm.py               # 零件开发追踪、质量问题清单模型
│   │   │   ├── ctq.py               # 关键特性模型 (KPC/KCC)
│   │   │   └── attachment.py        # 通用附件元数据台账
│   │   ├── routers/                 # 业务 API 路由分包
│   │   │   ├── r_maindata.py        # 1. 主数据接口 (供应商/零件/项目)
│   │   │   ├── r_sqm.py             # 2. 供应商质量接口 (开发管理/质量问题与改善报告)
│   │   │   ├── r_ctq.py             # 3. 关键特性接口 (KPC/KCC)
│   │   │   └── r_storage.py         # 动态附件流式上传与安全分发接口
│   │   └── schemas/                 # Pydantic 数据契约定义
│   └── requirements.txt             # 依赖包 (fastapi, uvicorn, sqlalchemy, alembic, pymysql)
└── frontend/                        # 前端工程 (Vue 3 + Element Plus)
    ├── index.html
    ├── package.json
    ├── vite.config.ts
    └── src/
        ├── App.vue
        ├── main.ts                  # 全局注册 Element Plus 与 Alt+X 快捷键监听
        ├── router/                  # 模块化路由配置 (免密直进工作台)
        │   └── index.ts
        ├── layout/                  # 主布局外壳
        │   ├── LeftSidebar.vue      # 左侧编号分级主导航
        │   └── MainWorkspace.vue    # 右侧工作区视窗
        ├── views/                   # 分功能编号业务目录 (列表与表单物理分离)
        │   ├── 1_maindata/          # 1. 主数据模块
        │   │   ├── 1.1_supplier/    # 1.1 供应商
        │   │   │   ├── SupplierList.vue # 列表页
        │   │   │   └── SupplierForm.vue # 70% 滑出抽屉表单 (含未保存防呆)
        │   │   ├── 1.2_part/        # 1.2 零件清单
        │   │   │   ├── PartList.vue
        │   │   │   └── PartForm.vue
        │   │   └── 1.3_project/     # 1.3 项目清单
        │   │       ├── ProjectList.vue
        │   │       └── ProjectForm.vue
        │   ├── 2_sqm/               # 2. 供应商质量管理模块
        │   │   ├── 2.1_part_dev/    # 2.1 零件开发管理
        │   │   │   ├── PartDevList.vue
        │   │   │   └── PartDevForm.vue
        │   │   └── 2.2_quality_issue/ # 2.2 质量问题清单
        │   │       ├── QualityIssueList.vue
        │   │       └── QualityIssueForm.vue # 质量记录与改善报告附件
        │   └── 3_ctq/               # 3. 关键质量特性模块
        │       └── 3.1_ctq/
        │           ├── CTQList.vue
        │           └── CTQForm.vue
        └── components/              # 独立功能解耦组件包
            ├── dev/                 # [核心新增] 开发态独立辅助包
            │   └── teleprompter/    # AI 提词器 (Alt+X 唤出、DOM 元素拾取、信标提取)
            │       ├── index.vue    # 提词面板界面
            │       └── usePicker.ts # 鼠标接管与元素拾取逻辑
            ├── editor/              # 富文本独立组件包 (WangEditor 5)
            │   ├── index.vue
            │   ├── config.ts
            │   └── types.ts
            ├── uploader/            # 文件上传独立组件包 (流式上传适配)
            │   ├── index.vue
            │   ├── useUploader.ts
            │   └── types.ts
            └── common/              # 通用原子基础组件 (表单脏检查防呆弹窗等)</span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="w-e-element-2662" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2663" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">6. 目标机器平滑同步操作流</span></span></span></h2><p id="w-e-element-2664" data-slate-node="element"><span id="w-e-text-2665" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">将项目迁移至密码为 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2666" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">Tars123451</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2667" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 的新电脑时，严格按如下三步保障历史数据与存储隔离：</span></span></span></p><div id="w-e-element-2668" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">1.</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2669" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">配置生效</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2670" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：在新电脑 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2671" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">.env</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2672" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 中配置 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2673" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">DB_PASSWORD=Tars123451</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2674" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 及 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2675" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">STORAGE_ROOT_PATH=../storage</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2676" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2677" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">2.</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2678" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">历史数据安全升级</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2679" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：进入 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2680" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">backend</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2681" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 目录执行 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2682" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">alembic upgrade head</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2683" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">，Alembic 自动对已有历史数据的 MySQL 执行增量升级，不触动现有记录。</span></span></span></span></div><div id="w-e-element-2684" data-slate-node="element" style="margin: 5px 0px;"><span contenteditable="false" data-w-e-reserve="true" style="margin-right: 0.5em;">3.</span><span><span id="w-e-text-2685" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><strong class="token bold"><span data-slate-string="true">服务启动</span></strong></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2686" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">：运行 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2687" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">uvicorn app.main:app --reload</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2688" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true"> 与 </span></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2689" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><code><span data-slate-string="true">npm run dev</span></code></span></span><span id="w-e-text-2690" data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-string="true">，实现极速交付。</span></span></span></span></div></div>
          </div>
        </body>
        </html>
      